  "notes": "Normalized from a noisy profile. Sub-12px font sizes (9.2/9.9/12px etc.) are the dense legal/compliance footer, collapsed to a 0.75/0.875rem caption tier. The #0000EE blue (counts ~86) is almost entirely unstyled legal-footer links, NOT a decorative accent — recorded only as roles.link; the real action color is black. Zero box-shadows in the profile: separation is hairline borders (#dce2ea / #f1f4f7) + whitespace, so shadow is ['none']. Three type families confirmed: Denton (serif display, weight 300), Inter (UI/body 400), Invest Pro (numerals/data). H1 48px desktop / 32px mobile; body 16px both. Inverted full-black bands flip bg/fg. Motion is minimal: 7 fixed-position pins are all sticky header/nav chrome; rotating CTA glow = borderTurn keyframes (a turning conic gradient, not a cursor follower); 4 autoplay product videos."
